  "duration_s": 505.041667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "二零一六年九月二十五日，贵州的平塘大窝荡中国天眼正式落成启用，现场一片欢腾。所有人都在鼓掌，拥抱合影，只有一个人安安静静的坐在角落里。他刚做完肺癌手术没多久，为了这一天，他等了二十二年，他比谁都清楚。这是他第一次也是最后一次亲眼看着天眼工作，这个人就是南人。东时间倒回到二零一五年，天眼工程进入最关键的攻坚阶段。南仁东的身体却开始不对劲了，直嗽发低烧人一天比一天瘦。同事劝他去医院，他摆摆手说工地上走不烧。咳到有一天他实在撑不住了。去检查，结果出来后，所有人都傻了眼，确定是肺癌晚期。医生说的很直白，太晚了，你猜南仁东的第一反应是什么？不是崩溃，不是害怕。他问医生，能不能让我把天眼见成再走这个病？他瞒着妻子，瞒着儿女，一个人扛了下来手术。他做了化疗，他也做了头发，一把一把的掉喉咙，嘶哑的几乎说不出话。可术后第三个月，他就出现在了工地上。同事们吓坏了。南老，您怎么来了？您得好好休息呀，他摆摆手不说话，不是不想说是怕一张嘴，那嘶哑的声音能让人听出他病的有多重？工地上有一个让所有人心疼的画面，南仁东太虚弱了，站都站不住，就坐在椅子上盯着施公说不出话，他就趴在桌上画图纸，一笔一笔画到手指发抖，给他看病的医生都理解不了，这到底是个什么人，都病成这个样子了，怎么还在工作，自己的病是一点都不顾了。同事们更想不通，几个月前还在工地上忙前忙后的男老怎么说，突然肺癌晚期就是肺癌晚期了。其实答案很简单，他一直都在硬撑。从二零一一年开工那天起，他就没给自己留过退路。那两年在他身边的人还发现了一件事，南老好像变了，变得冷漠了。亲戚来北京看他他不接待，从小要好的朋友知道他病了，打电话过来，他几乎不接工作中往来的邮件，他永远在最后加一句不必回复，只人心里犯嘀咕，南老这是怎么了？病糊涂了，还是心变硬了。只有离他最近的同事都明白，他不是冷漠，他是没时间了。他知道前面还有大量的工作，等着他他知道自己随时可能倒下。他要把剩下的每一分每一秒都留给建造天眼。二零一六年九月二十五日，天眼终于落成。那天晚上星光特别好，所有人都围在一起庆祝，只有南仁东一个人慢慢走到观测系统前坐下来看了很久很久。嗯，没人知道，那一刻他在想些什么，他只是安安静静的看着那口。世界上最大的郭看着他第一次睁开眼望向星空。有人说那天夜里，他看到了深夜升起的太阳。这是南仁东第一次使用天眼，也是最后一次。二零一七年九月十五日，南仁东走了，享年七十二岁，离建造天眼落成还不到一年的时间，他走的很安静，没有盛大的追悼会，没有气派的墓碑，连骨灰都遵照他的遗愿洒在了大窝荡的群山之间。他生前说过这么一句话，人这一辈子总要做一些事情，哪怕只做一件，也要做到极致。他做到了。可这句话是用命做出来的。还有一个细节，很多人不知道，这样一个为国铸剑的人，一辈子没当过院士，他生前不爱宣传自己，很多荣誉都让了出去。可他悄悄做的一件事，很多人不知道，他常年把自己的工资一笔又一笔捐给大山里的贫困学生。他自己呢只有一件旧夹克，穿了好多年出差，坐的是绿皮火车，却舍不得为自己多花一分钱。这就是南人东对自己抠搜了一辈子，把所有的光都奉献给了别人。二零一八年，国际天文学联合会将一颗小行星正式命名为南仁东星。那颗星离我们很远，很远远到要用光年去算。可天眼那个他拼了命建出来的中国天眼，就静静的守在中国西南的大山里。他每捕捉到一次来自宇宙深处的信号，都像是男老，还在替我们仰望星空。南仁东先生已经不在了，但中国天眼永远矗立在那里，天上那颗名为南人东星永远都亮着。这个系列讲完了，可我还想问你一个问题，南仁东这样的人，咱们的孩子认识几个？我见过太多孩子能爆出明星的生日，却叫不出一个科学家的名字。这个连墓碑都没留下的老人，不该只活在一天的新闻里，他应该被写进书里，放在孩子的床头。视频中。这本书国之脊梁，中国院士的科学人生百年，是由中国科学院学部科学人生百年项目组编的。书中四十位院士，三十三个学科领域，钱学森、郭永怀、程开甲、朱光亚等等，每一位都是把命交给国家的人。国家出版基金项目，认准正版科学群星耀华夏院士精神代代传。这句话就印在这本书上。咱们这一代记得他们还不够得让孙子孙女为戴，也记得他们视频左下角的链接，点进去给家里的孩子带一本这四十个故事，四十个把命交给国家的人，值得放在孩子枕边。如果你也被这位老人打动，点个关注点个赞、收藏，转发给更多的人。让这个时代的年轻人知道，中国天眼的背后，有一个叫南仁东的老头，拼尽了一生，只为做一件事做到极致。感谢你看到这里，咱们下个故事见。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00001",
      "start_ms": 70,
      "end_ms": 2310,
      "text": "二零一六年九月二十五日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2790,
      "end_ms": 8109,
      "text": "贵州的平塘大窝荡中国天眼正式落成启用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8610,
      "end_ms": 10450,
      "text": "现场一片欢腾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10990,
      "end_ms": 12730,
      "text": "所有人都在鼓掌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13090,
      "end_ms": 14530,
      "text": "拥抱合影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15250,
      "end_ms": 18830,
      "text": "只有一个人安安静静的坐在角落里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19650,
      "end_ms": 21950,
      "text": "他刚做完肺癌手术没多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22250,
      "end_ms": 23210,
      "text": "为了这一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23430,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "他等了二十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25290,
      "end_ms": 26730,
      "text": "他比谁都清楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27090,
      "end_ms": 32560,
      "text": "这是他第一次也是最后一次亲眼看着天眼工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33000,
      "end_ms": 35260,
      "text": "这个人就是南人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00013",
      "start_ms": 35260,
      "end_ms": 37700,
      "text": "东时间倒回到二零一五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00014",
      "start_ms": 38660,
      "end_ms": 42560,
      "text": "天眼工程进入最关键的攻坚阶段。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00015",
      "start_ms": 43380,
      "end_ms": 46680,
      "text": "南仁东的身体却开始不对劲了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00016",
      "start_ms": 47780,
      "end_ms": 52920,
      "text": "直嗽发低烧人一天比一天瘦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00017",
      "start_ms": 53460,
      "end_ms": 54820,
      "text": "同事劝他去医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00018",
      "start_ms": 54940,
      "end_ms": 57940,
      "text": "他摆摆手说工地上走不烧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00019",
      "start_ms": 58680,
      "end_ms": 61030,
      "text": "咳到有一天他实在撑不住了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00020",
      "start_ms": 61110,
      "end_ms": 61875,
      "text": "去检查，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00021",
      "start_ms": 62930,
      "end_ms": 63915,
      "text": "结果出来后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64360,
      "end_ms": 65755,
      "text": "所有人都傻了眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00023",
      "start_ms": 66070,
      "end_ms": 67425,
      "text": "确定是肺癌晚期。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00024",
      "start_ms": 67930,
      "end_ms": 69290,
      "text": "医生说的很直白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00025",
      "start_ms": 69450,
      "end_ms": 70165,
      "text": "太晚了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00026",
      "start_ms": 71250,
      "end_ms": 73710,
      "text": "你猜南仁东的第一反应是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00027",
      "start_ms": 73770,
      "end_ms": 74590,
      "text": "不是崩溃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00028",
      "start_ms": 74630,
      "end_ms": 75485,
      "text": "不是害怕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00029",
      "start_ms": 76320,
      "end_ms": 77235,
      "text": "他问医生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77740,
      "end_ms": 83300,
      "text": "能不能让我把天眼见成再走这个病？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00031",
      "start_ms": 83480,
      "end_ms": 84660,
      "text": "他瞒着妻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00032",
      "start_ms": 84840,
      "end_ms": 85685,
      "text": "瞒着儿女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85990,
      "end_ms": 89315,
      "text": "一个人扛了下来手术。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00034",
      "start_ms": 90690,
      "end_ms": 94005,
      "text": "他做了化疗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00035",
      "start_ms": 94480,
      "end_ms": 96020,
      "text": "他也做了头发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00036",
      "start_ms": 96080,
      "end_ms": 97820,
      "text": "一把一把的掉喉咙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00037",
      "start_ms": 97820,
      "end_ms": 99525,
      "text": "嘶哑的几乎说不出话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00038",
      "start_ms": 99960,
      "end_ms": 101335,
      "text": "可术后第三个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00039",
      "start_ms": 101670,
      "end_ms": 103275,
      "text": "他就出现在了工地上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00040",
      "start_ms": 103710,
      "end_ms": 104855,
      "text": "同事们吓坏了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00041",
      "start_ms": 106770,
      "end_ms": 107265,
      "text": "南老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00042",
      "start_ms": 107750,
      "end_ms": 108715,
      "text": "您怎么来了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00043",
      "start_ms": 109630,
      "end_ms": 111075,
      "text": "您得好好休息呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00044",
      "start_ms": 112050,
      "end_ms": 114555,
      "text": "他摆摆手不说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00045",
      "start_ms": 115750,
      "end_ms": 118900,
      "text": "不是不想说是怕一张嘴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00046",
      "start_ms": 119020,
      "end_ms": 122715,
      "text": "那嘶哑的声音能让人听出他病的有多重？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00047",
      "start_ms": 123630,
      "end_ms": 127795,
      "text": "工地上有一个让所有人心疼的画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00048",
      "start_ms": 128150,
      "end_ms": 130115,
      "text": "南仁东太虚弱了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00049",
      "start_ms": 130930,
      "end_ms": 131885,
      "text": "站都站不住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00050",
      "start_ms": 132210,
      "end_ms": 135825,
      "text": "就坐在椅子上盯着施公说不出话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00051",
      "start_ms": 136420,
      "end_ms": 138335,
      "text": "他就趴在桌上画图纸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00052",
      "start_ms": 138640,
      "end_ms": 140965,
      "text": "一笔一笔画到手指发抖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00053",
      "start_ms": 141800,
      "end_ms": 143800,
      "text": "给他看病的医生都理解不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00054",
      "start_ms": 144040,
      "end_ms": 145395,
      "text": "这到底是个什么人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00055",
      "start_ms": 146160,
      "end_ms": 147780,
      "text": "都病成这个样子了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00056",
      "start_ms": 147820,
      "end_ms": 148960,
      "text": "怎么还在工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00057",
      "start_ms": 149260,
      "end_ms": 151455,
      "text": "自己的病是一点都不顾了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00058",
      "start_ms": 152460,
      "end_ms": 153840,
      "text": "同事们更想不通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00059",
      "start_ms": 153980,
      "end_ms": 158180,
      "text": "几个月前还在工地上忙前忙后的男老怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00060",
      "start_ms": 158260,
      "end_ms": 161175,
      "text": "突然肺癌晚期就是肺癌晚期了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00061",
      "start_ms": 162020,
      "end_ms": 163505,
      "text": "其实答案很简单，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00062",
      "start_ms": 163910,
      "end_ms": 165665,
      "text": "他一直都在硬撑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00063",
      "start_ms": 166600,
      "end_ms": 169435,
      "text": "从二零一一年开工那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00064",
      "start_ms": 169980,
      "end_ms": 171825,
      "text": "他就没给自己留过退路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00065",
      "start_ms": 172680,
      "end_ms": 176685,
      "text": "那两年在他身边的人还发现了一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00066",
      "start_ms": 177090,
      "end_ms": 178255,
      "text": "南老好像变了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00067",
      "start_ms": 179380,
      "end_ms": 182700,
      "text": "变得冷漠了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00068",
      "start_ms": 183640,
      "end_ms": 187880,
      "text": "亲戚来北京看他他不接待，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00069",
      "start_ms": 188240,
      "end_ms": 190500,
      "text": "从小要好的朋友知道他病了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00070",
      "start_ms": 191180,
      "end_ms": 192180,
      "text": "打电话过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00071",
      "start_ms": 192280,
      "end_ms": 195940,
      "text": "他几乎不接工作中往来的邮件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00072",
      "start_ms": 196020,
      "end_ms": 199060,
      "text": "他永远在最后加一句不必回复，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00073",
      "start_ms": 200020,
      "end_ms": 201500,
      "text": "只人心里犯嘀咕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00074",
      "start_ms": 202320,
      "end_ms": 203720,
      "text": "南老这是怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00075",
      "start_ms": 204480,
      "end_ms": 205580,
      "text": "病糊涂了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00076",
      "start_ms": 205740,
      "end_ms": 207260,
      "text": "还是心变硬了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00077",
      "start_ms": 208320,
      "end_ms": 210660,
      "text": "只有离他最近的同事都明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00078",
      "start_ms": 211060,
      "end_ms": 212040,
      "text": "他不是冷漠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00079",
      "start_ms": 212240,
      "end_ms": 213420,
      "text": "他是没时间了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00080",
      "start_ms": 214160,
      "end_ms": 217470,
      "text": "他知道前面还有大量的工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00081",
      "start_ms": 217510,
      "end_ms": 222190,
      "text": "等着他他知道自己随时可能倒下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00082",
      "start_ms": 223070,
      "end_ms": 229190,
      "text": "他要把剩下的每一分每一秒都留给建造天眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00083",
      "start_ms": 229590,
      "end_ms": 231870,
      "text": "二零一六年九月二十五日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00084",
      "start_ms": 232290,
      "end_ms": 234150,
      "text": "天眼终于落成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00085",
      "start_ms": 235350,
      "end_ms": 237310,
      "text": "那天晚上星光特别好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00086",
      "start_ms": 237510,
      "end_ms": 239675,
      "text": "所有人都围在一起庆祝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00087",
      "start_ms": 240180,
      "end_ms": 245865,
      "text": "只有南仁东一个人慢慢走到观测系统前坐下来看了很久很久。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00088",
      "start_ms": 246140,
      "end_ms": 246310,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00089",
      "start_ms": 246370,
      "end_ms": 247030,
      "text": "没人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00090",
      "start_ms": 247030,
      "end_ms": 248665,
      "text": "那一刻他在想些什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00091",
      "start_ms": 249110,
      "end_ms": 251450,
      "text": "他只是安安静静的看着那口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00092",
      "start_ms": 251510,
      "end_ms": 258455,
      "text": "世界上最大的郭看着他第一次睁开眼望向星空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00093",
      "start_ms": 259320,
      "end_ms": 261145,
      "text": "有人说那天夜里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00094",
      "start_ms": 261450,
      "end_ms": 263855,
      "text": "他看到了深夜升起的太阳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00095",
      "start_ms": 264570,
      "end_ms": 266845,
      "text": "这是南仁东第一次使用天眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00096",
      "start_ms": 267690,
      "end_ms": 269025,
      "text": "也是最后一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00097",
      "start_ms": 270230,
      "end_ms": 272150,
      "text": "二零一七年九月十五日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00098",
      "start_ms": 272230,
      "end_ms": 273330,
      "text": "南仁东走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00099",
      "start_ms": 273650,
      "end_ms": 275075,
      "text": "享年七十二岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00100",
      "start_ms": 275530,
      "end_ms": 279635,
      "text": "离建造天眼落成还不到一年的时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00101",
      "start_ms": 280000,
      "end_ms": 281295,
      "text": "他走的很安静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00102",
      "start_ms": 281710,
      "end_ms": 283255,
      "text": "没有盛大的追悼会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00103",
      "start_ms": 283590,
      "end_ms": 285125,
      "text": "没有气派的墓碑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00104",
      "start_ms": 285610,
      "end_ms": 291675,
      "text": "连骨灰都遵照他的遗愿洒在了大窝荡的群山之间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00105",
      "start_ms": 292600,
      "end_ms": 294965,
      "text": "他生前说过这么一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00106",
      "start_ms": 295890,
      "end_ms": 299595,
      "text": "人这一辈子总要做一些事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00107",
      "start_ms": 300550,
      "end_ms": 301830,
      "text": "哪怕只做一件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00108",
      "start_ms": 302250,
      "end_ms": 303670,
      "text": "也要做到极致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00109",
      "start_ms": 304490,
      "end_ms": 305955,
      "text": "他做到了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00110",
      "start_ms": 306630,
      "end_ms": 310130,
      "text": "可这句话是用命做出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00111",
      "start_ms": 311190,
      "end_ms": 312410,
      "text": "还有一个细节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00112",
      "start_ms": 312490,
      "end_ms": 313430,
      "text": "很多人不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00113",
      "start_ms": 313870,
      "end_ms": 315750,
      "text": "这样一个为国铸剑的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00114",
      "start_ms": 316050,
      "end_ms": 318570,
      "text": "一辈子没当过院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00115",
      "start_ms": 319090,
      "end_ms": 320850,
      "text": "他生前不爱宣传自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00116",
      "start_ms": 321150,
      "end_ms": 322990,
      "text": "很多荣誉都让了出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00117",
      "start_ms": 323310,
      "end_ms": 325030,
      "text": "可他悄悄做的一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00118",
      "start_ms": 325570,
      "end_ms": 326650,
      "text": "很多人不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00119",
      "start_ms": 327470,
      "end_ms": 333650,
      "text": "他常年把自己的工资一笔又一笔捐给大山里的贫困学生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00120",
      "start_ms": 334570,
      "end_ms": 337740,
      "text": "他自己呢只有一件旧夹克，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00121",
      "start_ms": 338580,
      "end_ms": 341100,
      "text": "穿了好多年出差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00122",
      "start_ms": 341140,
      "end_ms": 342900,
      "text": "坐的是绿皮火车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00123",
      "start_ms": 343440,
      "end_ms": 345880,
      "text": "却舍不得为自己多花一分钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00124",
      "start_ms": 346660,
      "end_ms": 350400,
      "text": "这就是南人东对自己抠搜了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00125",
      "start_ms": 350400,
      "end_ms": 353300,
      "text": "把所有的光都奉献给了别人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00126",
      "start_ms": 353840,
      "end_ms": 354800,
      "text": "二零一八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00127",
      "start_ms": 355100,
      "end_ms": 361260,
      "text": "国际天文学联合会将一颗小行星正式命名为南仁东星。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00128",
      "start_ms": 362000,
      "end_ms": 363960,
      "text": "那颗星离我们很远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00129",
      "start_ms": 363980,
      "end_ms": 366875,
      "text": "很远远到要用光年去算。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00130",
      "start_ms": 367250,
      "end_ms": 371075,
      "text": "可天眼那个他拼了命建出来的中国天眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00131",
      "start_ms": 371600,
      "end_ms": 375385,
      "text": "就静静的守在中国西南的大山里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00132",
      "start_ms": 376180,
      "end_ms": 379915,
      "text": "他每捕捉到一次来自宇宙深处的信号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00133",
      "start_ms": 380400,
      "end_ms": 381600,
      "text": "都像是男老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00134",
      "start_ms": 381980,
      "end_ms": 384285,
      "text": "还在替我们仰望星空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00135",
      "start_ms": 384870,
      "end_ms": 387090,
      "text": "南仁东先生已经不在了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00136",
      "start_ms": 387090,
      "end_ms": 390155,
      "text": "但中国天眼永远矗立在那里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00137",
      "start_ms": 390770,
      "end_ms": 394555,
      "text": "天上那颗名为南人东星永远都亮着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00138",
      "start_ms": 395740,
      "end_ms": 397375,
      "text": "这个系列讲完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00139",
      "start_ms": 397800,
      "end_ms": 399285,
      "text": "可我还想问你一个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00140",
      "start_ms": 399790,
      "end_ms": 401065,
      "text": "南仁东这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00141",
      "start_ms": 401630,
      "end_ms": 403975,
      "text": "咱们的孩子认识几个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00142",
      "start_ms": 404800,
      "end_ms": 409085,
      "text": "我见过太多孩子能爆出明星的生日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00143",
      "start_ms": 409480,
      "end_ms": 411925,
      "text": "却叫不出一个科学家的名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00144",
      "start_ms": 412480,
      "end_ms": 414925,
      "text": "这个连墓碑都没留下的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00145",
      "start_ms": 415540,
      "end_ms": 417865,
      "text": "不该只活在一天的新闻里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00146",
      "start_ms": 418650,
      "end_ms": 420255,
      "text": "他应该被写进书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00147",
      "start_ms": 420890,
      "end_ms": 422495,
      "text": "放在孩子的床头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00148",
      "start_ms": 423770,
      "end_ms": 424430,
      "text": "视频中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00149",
      "start_ms": 424430,
      "end_ms": 425950,
      "text": "这本书国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00150",
      "start_ms": 425990,
      "end_ms": 428275,
      "text": "中国院士的科学人生百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00151",
      "start_ms": 428800,
      "end_ms": 433745,
      "text": "是由中国科学院学部科学人生百年项目组编的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00152",
      "start_ms": 434650,
      "end_ms": 436285,
      "text": "书中四十位院士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00153",
      "start_ms": 436720,
      "end_ms": 438385,
      "text": "三十三个学科领域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00154",
      "start_ms": 438970,
      "end_ms": 443210,
      "text": "钱学森、郭永怀、程开甲、朱光亚等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00155",
      "start_ms": 443460,
      "end_ms": 447115,
      "text": "每一位都是把命交给国家的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00156",
      "start_ms": 448140,
      "end_ms": 449635,
      "text": "国家出版基金项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00157",
      "start_ms": 449940,
      "end_ms": 455815,
      "text": "认准正版科学群星耀华夏院士精神代代传。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00158",
      "start_ms": 456870,
      "end_ms": 460025,
      "text": "这句话就印在这本书上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00159",
      "start_ms": 460410,
      "end_ms": 466265,
      "text": "咱们这一代记得他们还不够得让孙子孙女为戴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00160",
      "start_ms": 466590,
      "end_ms": 469400,
      "text": "也记得他们视频左下角的链接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00161",
      "start_ms": 469420,
      "end_ms": 474935,
      "text": "点进去给家里的孩子带一本这四十个故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00162",
      "start_ms": 475660,
      "end_ms": 478375,
      "text": "四十个把命交给国家的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00163",
      "start_ms": 478920,
      "end_ms": 480655,
      "text": "值得放在孩子枕边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00164",
      "start_ms": 481140,
      "end_ms": 483215,
      "text": "如果你也被这位老人打动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00165",
      "start_ms": 483620,
      "end_ms": 485950,
      "text": "点个关注点个赞、收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00166",
      "start_ms": 486190,
      "end_ms": 487505,
      "text": "转发给更多的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00167",
      "start_ms": 488580,
      "end_ms": 490725,
      "text": "让这个时代的年轻人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00168",
      "start_ms": 492310,
      "end_ms": 494195,
      "text": "中国天眼的背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00169",
      "start_ms": 494700,
      "end_ms": 496735,
      "text": "有一个叫南仁东的老头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ef3ff63b4ef80a06_s00170",
      "start_ms": 497110,
      "end_ms": 498045,
      "text": "拼尽了一生，"
